  m_Name: StationType_Carousel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ASRS_Station_Type
  displayName: Carousel
  summary: A rotating storage station. Storage positions are arranged around a carousel
    that turns to bring the requested position to one fixed load/unload point, so
    the part comes to the robot instead of the robot travelling to the part.
  details: 'Compact and mechanically simple: one rotary motion moves all of the stock.
    In a CIM cell it serves as a small automated buffer of parts or templates next
    to the robot that loads and unloads it.'
